    "text": "Solving <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />we get,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> { <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> otherwise <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is not defined}<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2,4</mn></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/5620c62a-6bc0-4cff-9eb3-71ee6ef21934.png\" style=\"width:1.51042in;height:1.20833in\" /><br />Now, the area of <math><mi mathvariant